From ef3e6efcb96ad62edaa9443a7afe04c109a67445 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antonio Borneo <antonio.borneo@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:44:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: configs: drop kernel address space randomization

To allow kernel debugging, drop CONFIG_RANDOMIZE_BASE.

Signed-off-by: Antonio Borneo <antonio.borneo@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I9d84f3eac13128982bdec3b162bac82dc1eeaa62
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/612864
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/stm32mp_defconfig | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

--- a/arch/arm64/configs/stm32mp_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/stm32mp_defconfig
@@ -40,7 +40,6 @@ CONFIG_SCHED_SMT=y
 CONFIG_NUMA=y
 CONFIG_XEN=y
 CONFIG_COMPAT=y
-CONFIG_RANDOMIZE_BASE=y
 CONFIG_HIBERNATION=y
 CONFIG_WQ_POWER_EFFICIENT_DEFAULT=y
 CONFIG_ENERGY_MODEL=y
